<title>USA: CATTLE-FAX AVERAGE FEEDLOT CATTLE PRICES - AUG 6.</title>
<headline>CATTLE-FAX AVERAGE FEEDLOT CATTLE PRICES - AUG 6.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average prices for feedlot steers in the main U.S. six-state and three-state regions, according to CATTLE-FAX (in dollars per cwt) --</p>
<p>6 STATES -</p>
<p> Tuesday	   Aug   5  $65.86    dn 0.42</p>
<p> Monday	    Aug   4  $66.28    up 0.01</p>
<p> Friday	    Aug   1  $66.27    unch</p>
<p>3 STATES -</p>
<p> Tuesday	   Aug   5  $65.53    dn 0.49</p>
<p> Monday	    Aug   4  $66.02    unch</p>
<p> Friday	    Aug   1  $66.02    unch</p>
<p>Note: 6 states include TX, NE, KS, CO, OK, IA.</p>
<p>	    3 states include TX, KS, OK.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720))</p>
